                </div>
                <p><strong>Teacher key, not automatic grading:</strong> A–J (25);
                    B–K (14); C–G (12); D–H (20); E–F (30); I–L (12).
                    Cards use different group orientations. Partners must match
                    representations and then explain why a row or column represents
                    the corresponding equal group; MLR1 requires revising the explanation
