                        then separately 7 × 5 = 35. The question generation and drawn
                        representation remain teacher-reviewed.</p>
                    <div role="img" aria-label="Seven equal rows, each containing five independently drawn crayon-shaped counters."
                         style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,15px);gap:7px;margin:12px 0">
                        @for(var crayon=0;crayon<35;crayon++){
                            <span aria-hidden="true" style="height:24px;width:12px;background:#bf7252;border-radius:5px 5px 2px 2px"></span>
