                </details>
                <h2>Source Activity 2: two separate coconut-tree arrays</h2>
                <p>The source has one grove with five rows of nine trees and Tyler's backyard with two rows of four trees. Model and solve each individually. Enter the FULL equation (including both factors and the product), and show how the question-mark version becomes the completed version. A numeric total alone does not satisfy an equation-writing task.</p>
